WEBVTT

00:46.588 --> 00:47.589
Hold on a second.

00:50.383 --> 00:52.218
How the hell do we move this thing?

00:52.302 --> 00:53.261
I have no clue!

00:53.344 --> 00:55.722
But look, Miss Ayase! The kaiju is coming!

00:55.805 --> 00:57.348
Wait up! Hold on!

00:57.432 --> 00:59.601
Can I push this button?
Will it not explode?

00:59.684 --> 01:01.394
There's a lever! Should I pull it?

01:01.478 --> 01:03.897
Why have you locked me up
in a place like this?

01:03.980 --> 01:07.609
Calm down! Everyone, listen to me!

01:08.193 --> 01:10.153
I'm going to check the manual.

01:11.071 --> 01:12.405
Amazing.

01:12.489 --> 01:14.824
The energy gain is over fivefold.

01:14.908 --> 01:16.409
- I wanna kick this guy!
- Let me out!

01:16.493 --> 01:17.744
All right, everyone!

01:17.827 --> 01:19.954
Let's all push a button of our choice!

01:27.045 --> 01:28.379
- It exploded!
- Let me out!

01:28.463 --> 01:29.589
I think that was my fault!

01:29.672 --> 01:32.008
Don't do it all at once!

01:33.301 --> 01:36.012
DANGER
INVISIBLE KAIJU / BIG

01:36.095 --> 01:38.139
THAT'S A HORN / THOSE ARE EYES

01:38.223 --> 01:40.266
ESS EFF

02:07.127 --> 02:08.795
Gimme a break, you punk!

03:09.689 --> 03:11.024
Miss Ayase?

03:13.067 --> 03:15.236
- Freedom!
- Evil Eye?

03:42.222 --> 03:44.724
Out! I'm finally out!

03:48.519 --> 03:50.355
Evil Eye! Are you okay?

03:53.942 --> 03:56.945
Did you do that? Can we engage
in a death match right now?

03:57.028 --> 03:59.989
Absolutely not!
This isn't the time for that!

04:06.204 --> 04:08.539
What's that? It's huge!

04:08.623 --> 04:11.668
Oh no! Miss Ayase
and the others are still inside!

04:11.751 --> 04:12.752
Is it strong?

04:12.835 --> 04:13.962
It's too strong!

04:14.045 --> 04:16.256
What am I supposed to do
against something like that?

04:20.593 --> 04:21.719
Miss Ayase!

04:21.803 --> 04:23.888
I want to fight that thing!

04:25.974 --> 04:29.143
What should I do? At this rate...

04:37.777 --> 04:39.862
Evil Eye! Just this once...

04:50.832 --> 04:55.211
I finally figured out
how to move this thing.

04:57.046 --> 05:01.384
If it's a robot made out of nanoskin,
then all I have to do is visualize, right?

05:01.467 --> 05:07.932
For me, it was my dream
to pilot a giant robot!

05:08.891 --> 05:11.436
I've watched countless robot anime shows

05:11.519 --> 05:14.272
and imagined it
tens of thousands of times.

05:14.355 --> 05:16.733
Amazing! The nanoskin...

05:17.358 --> 05:19.360
regenerated and transformed!

05:21.362 --> 05:23.573
You could say I am the robot itself.

05:23.656 --> 05:25.616
No, the robot is me!

05:25.700 --> 05:27.535
What are you yapping on about?

05:28.369 --> 05:32.165
Kinta the End of Joytoy Pegasus Sakata!

05:33.541 --> 05:34.917
Moving out!

07:20.398 --> 07:21.566
Here goes!

07:43.629 --> 07:45.506
This thing can move.

07:53.181 --> 07:54.223
Blazing Wind!

07:55.308 --> 07:57.894
Frontal Punch!

07:57.977 --> 08:00.605
Impressive!
You're actually moving it, Sakata!

08:00.688 --> 08:02.106
Keep at it and get 'em!

08:02.190 --> 08:05.610
Daedalus Achack!

08:21.167 --> 08:22.502
Rocket...

08:23.169 --> 08:24.629
Punch!

08:37.767 --> 08:39.101
Ultramagnetic Wave

08:39.185 --> 08:42.438
Tornado!

09:32.446 --> 09:34.490
- Hey, look at that guy.
- What is that?

09:34.574 --> 09:35.825
That otaku...

09:35.908 --> 09:37.910
- Isn't he gross?
- He brought it again.

09:37.994 --> 09:39.537
Ew! Gross!

09:55.219 --> 09:57.930
Watch where you're going!
Outta the way, moron!

09:58.014 --> 10:00.266
You still buy crap like that?

10:00.349 --> 10:02.852
Aren't you way too old for that?

10:04.395 --> 10:06.355
See ya, little boy!

10:06.439 --> 10:08.524
Later, Otaku!

10:39.805 --> 10:41.182
Who cares?

10:42.350 --> 10:44.060
What difference does it make?

10:44.143 --> 10:46.437
Because I love it so much!

10:46.937 --> 10:49.357
I...

10:51.025 --> 10:54.320
love robots!

10:56.030 --> 10:58.199
I have always been preparing.

10:59.909 --> 11:02.828
I believed that I'd pilot a robot someday!

11:03.829 --> 11:08.501
So I'm perfectly prepared
for robot motion sickness!

11:20.513 --> 11:23.224
Ultramagnetic Wave Spin!

11:33.192 --> 11:36.278
What happened?
I can't see anything from here!

11:42.034 --> 11:44.245
It's gone? Impossible!

11:44.328 --> 11:46.455
It was definitely here moments ago.

11:53.963 --> 11:55.506
I was hit?

11:55.589 --> 11:59.009
Could it be doing
its usual invisibility thing?

12:01.846 --> 12:04.140
Doing something like that is useless.

12:06.725 --> 12:11.689
I can create what I imagine
with this robot!

12:16.026 --> 12:19.029
Stop deploying airbags
each and every time!

12:24.952 --> 12:27.329
Hold on a sec!

12:27.413 --> 12:29.748
If I use the infrared scope...

12:29.832 --> 12:32.168
your guise will be exposed!

12:38.549 --> 12:40.009
The head broke!

12:40.092 --> 12:42.887
This guy is pretty flimsy!
Is it because it was originally a house?

12:42.970 --> 12:44.346
Sakata, run!

12:44.430 --> 12:46.515
Push the button on the bottom!

12:46.599 --> 12:50.102
Damn it! The airbag deployed,
so I can't reach it!

12:50.186 --> 12:54.231
Help me! I'm gonna die!

13:00.070 --> 13:01.906
I'm feeling sick.

13:01.989 --> 13:04.783
I'm beggin' ya,
please stay still for a little bit.

13:04.867 --> 13:07.786
This is way worse than seasickness.

13:08.370 --> 13:10.915
That's Miss Ayase's...

13:10.998 --> 13:11.957
It's huge!

13:12.041 --> 13:15.586
That robot can use
the abilities of its pilots!

13:21.091 --> 13:25.304
With this, we can see
that turd kaiju as clear as day!

13:28.390 --> 13:30.601
You will not be getting away with this.

13:30.684 --> 13:32.102
Aira, you okay?

13:32.978 --> 13:35.314
Aira, don't you dare let that guy go!

13:35.397 --> 13:37.525
Slowly! Move slowly!

13:37.608 --> 13:39.860
All right. Well done, you guys!

13:39.944 --> 13:43.822
Leave the rest to me,
Kinta Emperor Great Pegasus Sakata!

13:43.906 --> 13:46.909
Shut up! And you better not move this!

13:46.992 --> 13:49.495
When you move this,
we all get motion sickness!

13:49.578 --> 13:50.996
More like, who the hell are you?

13:51.080 --> 13:53.666
Momo Ayase! Hurry up and do something!

13:53.749 --> 13:55.376
I can't keep holding it back forever!

13:55.459 --> 13:58.963
Please wait!
It's not done regenerating yet!

13:59.046 --> 14:01.382
We can't attack in its current state!

14:01.465 --> 14:03.259
Each and every one of you...

14:03.342 --> 14:04.969
Just shut up already!

14:05.052 --> 14:07.471
There, problem solved!

14:17.147 --> 14:19.942
Get up there!

14:21.318 --> 14:22.653
Crap!

14:22.736 --> 14:24.488
- Hey!
- Huh?

14:24.572 --> 14:26.198
Run for it!

14:26.282 --> 14:27.616
Hurray!

14:36.500 --> 14:40.713
Take that! You get motion sickness, too!

14:43.173 --> 14:45.175
Watch closely, Perv!

14:45.259 --> 14:47.428
I'll show you how this is done!

14:49.305 --> 14:52.308
You don't punch or kick kaiju.

14:53.017 --> 14:55.185
Ya gotta go with a power bomb!

15:11.744 --> 15:13.120
Whoa! What the hell is this?

15:13.203 --> 15:14.663
It suddenly appeared outta nowhere!

15:14.747 --> 15:16.165
It's a robot!

15:16.749 --> 15:18.250
Crap! We're back!

15:18.334 --> 15:19.919
How do we put it back?

15:20.002 --> 15:21.795
Imagery! Visualize it!

15:22.546 --> 15:23.380
I see!

15:26.425 --> 15:28.552
- It's a UFO!
- It transformed into a UFO!

15:28.636 --> 15:29.845
No, it's a UAP!

15:29.929 --> 15:31.931
Crap! It turned into a UFO!

15:32.014 --> 15:34.141
It's fine, we just need to get back!

15:34.224 --> 15:35.434
Got it!

15:56.205 --> 16:00.334
I got to pilot a robot!

16:22.773 --> 16:24.274
Whoa! What the hell is this?

16:24.358 --> 16:25.818
It suddenly appeared outta nowhere!

16:25.901 --> 16:27.152
It's a robot!

16:33.951 --> 16:36.036
- It's a UFO!
- It transformed into a UFO!

16:36.120 --> 16:37.705
No, it's a UAP!

16:39.206 --> 16:43.627
Oh! I've been left behind! Miss Ayase!

16:45.921 --> 16:48.215
What the hell? It's a kaiju!

16:48.924 --> 16:50.843
Is it like an animal suit?

16:50.926 --> 16:52.553
Hello, excuse me!

16:54.304 --> 16:55.139
Whoa!

16:55.222 --> 16:57.224
The pocket space disappeared,
but it's still here!

16:58.642 --> 17:01.145
It's dangerous to leave
this guy alone here!

17:01.228 --> 17:04.023
Evil Eye!

17:08.152 --> 17:09.403
Evil Eye!

17:09.486 --> 17:12.531
What are you doing? Don't climb up there!

17:12.614 --> 17:16.201
No! Can't do this, can't do that!
I can't do a single thing!

17:16.285 --> 17:17.703
Just get down from there!

17:17.786 --> 17:19.121
No way!

17:19.204 --> 17:21.665
Sheesh! What should I...

17:25.044 --> 17:26.462
CITY OF PEACE KAMIGOE CITY

17:29.048 --> 17:30.841
Here, eat this!

17:37.306 --> 17:39.141
Hot! Tasty!

17:39.224 --> 17:40.809
It's tasty? I'm glad!

17:40.893 --> 17:42.478
Why am I eating a meat bun?

17:42.561 --> 17:44.813
Just help me carry the kaiju, please!

17:44.897 --> 17:46.315
Oh! Right, the kaiju!

17:46.398 --> 17:48.692
Where's the kaiju? Did we defeat it?

17:48.776 --> 17:50.319
It's totally tiny now!

17:50.402 --> 17:52.821
Come on, wake up!

17:54.156 --> 17:56.575
Mr. Jiji, please hold that end!

17:58.452 --> 17:59.745
Ready...

18:00.287 --> 18:01.622
Heavy!

18:07.461 --> 18:09.963
So what is this thing? A UMA?

18:10.047 --> 18:13.008
It's likely a large alien kaiju, probably!

18:13.092 --> 18:14.718
An alien kaiju?

18:14.802 --> 18:16.845
Sounds like it would never
eat takoyaki and stuff!

18:16.929 --> 18:18.680
I'm sure it won't eat that!

18:18.764 --> 18:21.850
This has got to be a ferocious,
carnivorous alien kaiju!

18:21.934 --> 18:25.771
No, it's a super delicious
ferocious carnivorous alien kaiju!

18:25.854 --> 18:30.150
It's a very, very ultra dreadnought class
carnivorous alien kaiju revised!

18:33.070 --> 18:34.613
Oh, crap!

18:35.322 --> 18:37.282
My back muscles can't take it anymore!

18:37.783 --> 18:39.701
We made it!

18:43.789 --> 18:45.249
My back muscles are...

18:45.791 --> 18:47.209
bom-ba-ye!

18:51.880 --> 18:53.507
Okarun, who the heck is this?

18:53.590 --> 18:56.885
I'm not sure, but I think
I'd have to call it a UMA,

18:56.969 --> 19:00.180
because UMAs
were called kaijus in the past.

19:00.264 --> 19:02.182
You're late, peons.

19:02.683 --> 19:03.684
BATHROOM

19:04.685 --> 19:07.104
You guys are completely useless.

19:07.187 --> 19:10.607
Sakata! That was amazing, how quickly
you figured out how to move it.

19:10.691 --> 19:11.650
Spare me.

19:12.651 --> 19:15.821
It was quite elementary!

19:17.030 --> 19:20.409
Especially for me!

19:21.201 --> 19:22.828
Kin-chan, you look so cool!

19:22.911 --> 19:24.830
Don't talk to me so casually,
Handsome Guy.

19:25.330 --> 19:27.207
Is Miss Ayase's side all right?

19:27.708 --> 19:28.876
They're fine.

19:30.419 --> 19:32.004
Thanks to me.

19:32.087 --> 19:33.672
I'm glad.

19:34.923 --> 19:37.092
Anyway, explain to me.

19:37.176 --> 19:42.139
Are you fighting to protect this planet
from those beings called kaiju?

19:42.222 --> 19:47.186
That's not really the case, but Miss Ayase
and I have been looking for a golden ball.

19:47.269 --> 19:50.480
And aliens and ghosts
are going after that golden ball.

19:50.564 --> 19:51.398
What?

19:51.481 --> 19:54.067
And we have to get that ball back.

19:54.151 --> 19:58.363
Can it be that this golden ball
has the fate of the world riding on it?

19:58.447 --> 20:00.574
No, it's not something that important.

20:00.657 --> 20:04.995
All right. I get it.
If you're gonna go that far, I shall...

20:05.579 --> 20:06.788
lend you my power!

20:06.872 --> 20:08.165
Oh, there's no need.

20:11.084 --> 20:13.795
Kin-chan, it's seriously some
stressful stuff, so you shouldn't.

20:13.879 --> 20:14.838
Hey, Handsome!

20:14.922 --> 20:16.673
I haven't forgotten, you hear?

20:16.757 --> 20:20.510
You're someone who I can't trust at all!

20:20.594 --> 20:23.055
If you befriend
a split personality guy like him,

20:23.138 --> 20:24.556
you can't protect this planet!

20:24.640 --> 20:26.183
Kin-chan is correct!

20:26.266 --> 20:29.561
I've been told not
to interfere that much, too!

20:29.645 --> 20:30.854
We're buddies!

20:38.195 --> 20:39.363
What's up?

20:39.446 --> 20:41.615
What's going on? Status report!

20:41.698 --> 20:45.118
I can see a part of a person
inside its mouth.

20:45.202 --> 20:46.119
Seriously?

20:46.203 --> 20:48.997
It can't be... Did it eat a human?

20:49.581 --> 20:51.959
- Handsome Guy! You check it out!
- What?

20:52.042 --> 20:54.253
No way! I can't handle any gore!

20:54.336 --> 20:55.545
You're so useless!

20:55.629 --> 20:57.965
What's the point of having
a hot guy like you around, then?

20:58.048 --> 21:00.926
Kin-chan, you're really harsh towards me!

21:01.009 --> 21:02.427
Did I do something to you?

21:02.511 --> 21:06.223
I'll check it out!
It's my own golden ball, after all.

21:08.016 --> 21:08.892
Huh?

21:09.518 --> 21:10.686
This is...

21:36.837 --> 21:39.131
Wait for me.

21:42.175 --> 21:44.177
Perv.

21:44.261 --> 21:46.388
Can you help us with fixing the house?
